{"title":"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/d/c8d5794f9399d77b8ab4892ac69bbc45316f0f45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = (0,9)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"76\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/6/8c6020dc377e3989766367a2183f4fa785a2ba3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B = (0,12)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"18\" />. <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Point\" title=\"Point\">Points</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/9/1090530ae883b627e090bfb5e450ef796febca40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A&#39;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/7/4c71f19552a05ee5e2b31e94aff3fb986884bf31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B&#39;$\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> are on the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Line\" title=\"Line\">line</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/0/a40fee4603b4536f856dde720ee499468ace443f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/e/6cee29e8c46b0074ecb11ec9eed51e26715a850c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AA&#39;}$\" width=\"32\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/0/2e0e06feaa3c61ff1386e726362f646529472c84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BB&#39;}$\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" /> intersect at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/5/f85d9313599e5037ba421c042dd287ad3dc89350.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C = (2,8)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"18\" />. What is the length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/6/a66bcf1b702aa4823d591a3a43757c06b3e45ca2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{A&#39;B&#39;}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"39\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/c/12c90e204599e741692ecd916ba260cfa607f5e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text {(A)} 2 \\qquad \\text {(B)} 2\\sqrt2 \\qquad \\text {(C)} 3 \\qquad \\text {(D)} 2 + \\sqrt 2\\qquad \\text {(E)}3\\sqrt 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"398\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:2004_AMC_12A-12.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/4/43/2004_AMC_12A-12.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"210\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p><p>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Equation\" title=\"Equation\">equation</a> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/e/6cee29e8c46b0074ecb11ec9eed51e26715a850c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AA&#39;}$\" width=\"32\" height=\"15\" /> can be found using points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/a/faafcc2f53726bb09ac20d940deb797970210fc7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A, C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/5/10596bd295e55f2f82b9d33edcb8db8723bbad96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y - 9 = \\left(\\frac{9-8}{0-2}\\right)(x - 0) \\Longrightarrow y = -\\frac{1}{2}x + 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"338\" height=\"45\" />. Similarily, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/0/2e0e06feaa3c61ff1386e726362f646529472c84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BB&#39;}$\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" /> has the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/a/80a4e846d85c98f0d6aa9e2a25430d0b90e0b91f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y - 12 = \\left(\\frac{12-8}{0-2}\\right)(x-0) \\Longrightarrow y = -2x + 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"359\" height=\"43\" />. These two equations intersect the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/1/741a74d86df899c10724dc2f80638f5e7f599194.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/7/8e7eedad8b0b501a894378bd3d1fdaf959e4eabf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(6,6)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/7/9e74a8a996f28bdc445eb3beaf3c3f14594eac27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(4,4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />. Using the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Distance_formula\" title=\"Distance formula\">distance formula</a> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/2/22231a5cdd4fe05a11f4b577e3b81221f3017a85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45-45-90$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"98\" height=\"13\" /> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Right_triangle\" title=\"Right triangle\">right triangles</a>, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/6/0964a141b4f843a45886830d0d036cef9890ce4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\sqrt{2}\\ \\mathrm{(B)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"64\" height=\"21\" />. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A\">2004 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.p